68#issuecomment-2534876756","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100268","id":2534876756,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XFyZU","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T08:23:54Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T08:26:21Z","body":"I use https://packages.msys2.org/groups/mingw-w64-clang-x86_64-toolchain which provided lldb version 19.1.4-1\nI tried with https://github.com/mstorsjo/llvm-mingw and that was the same.\n\nUsing dwarf-4 it make it work again, what should I do then ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2534876756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2534974403","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100268#issuecomment-2534974403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100268","id":2534974403,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XGKPD","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T08:31:09Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T08:31:09Z","body":"It may be because of lldb-dap https://github.com/mfussenegger/nvim-dap/issues/186#issuecomment-852382434","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2534974403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535319037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100268#issuecomment-2535319037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100268","id":2535319037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XHeX9","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T09:38:13Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T09:38:13Z","body":"Tested various configs:\n\n---\n\n## `drawf-4` symbols produces by `gcc`:\n\n- Doesn't work with `libbacktrace`.\n\n## `drawf-5` symbols produces by `gcc`:\n\n- Work in `gdb`:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60e2ed5a-0774-469d-9008-ae015ddefdfa)\n- Kinda work in `lldb`, but seems to have some issues, it's spamming a lot of `Failed to extract range list table at offset` error and does not show source lines (function names are shown).\n- Work with `libbacktrace`.\n\n---\n\n## `drawf-5` symbols produced by `clang`:\n\n- Doesn't work in `gdb`.\n- Work in the same half-broken way in `lldb`.\n- Doesn't work with `libbacktrace`.\n\n---\n\n## `drawf-4` symbols produced by `clang`:\n\n- Work in `gdb`.\n- Work in `lldb`, no error spam lines are show correctly:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a9a3071-cac0-49d2-9248-e2c72027c762)\n- Work with `libbacktrace`.\n\n---\n\nSo we should switch `clang` builds back to `drawf-4`.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535319037/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535339565","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100268#issuecomment-2535339565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100268","id":2535339565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XHjYt","user":{"login":"AeioMuch","id":75151379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MTUxMzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75151379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch","html_url":"https://github.com/AeioMuch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AeioMuch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T09:47:26Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T09:47:26Z","body":"Thank you for your tests! ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535339565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535341749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100268#issuecomment-2535341749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100268","id":2535341749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6XHj61","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-11T09:48:25Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T09:48:25Z","body":"> Kinda work in `lldb`, but seems to have some issues, it's spamming a lot of `Failed to extract range list table at offset` error and does not show source lines (function names are shown).\n\nSounds like this from the [GCC 11 release notes](https://gcc.gnu.org/gcc-11/changes.html):\n\n> To take full advantage of DWARF version 5 GCC needs to be built against binutils version 2.35.2 or higher. When GCC is built against earlier versions of binutils GCC will still emit DWARF version 5 for most debuginfo data, but will generate version 4 debug line tables (even when explicitly given `-gdwarf-5`). \n\nThere must be a mismatch between the debuginfo data and the debug line tables versions.\n\nLooking at libbacktrace's `dwarf.c` is seems to have code to support earlier dwarf versions than 5. Maybe we could revert back to dwarf-4 for all platforms and just find how to use libbacktrace to process dwarf-4 data explicitly?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2535341749/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]